        // or the contract's balance remains equal to before. We assert the safe property by
        // checking that after the call the contract balance is unchanged OR the call reverted.
        // This will always hold for the reference, but the mutant (which allows anyone to call)
        // will for some fuzzed inputs let ok==true and contract balance drop below before, causing
        // this assertion to fail.
